- 2026-11-12: accepted and implemented
- 2026-11-12: durable consumers; the `Nats` transport and `io.msg.nats`
- 2026-11-12: `nats` is a core subject; a subject of a stream is
  `nats_jetstream`, in `io.msg.nats_jetstream`
